 ; Blank postcard with image of A Landscape in the Style of Sesshu ; Blank postcard with image of Cryptomerias and Cedars on a Snowy Hillside.\nEphemera found between pp. 176-177 : Handwritten note by unknown : notes on Chinese dynasties ; Postcard from Charles Wickham Moore to Georgia O'Keeffe, April 24, 1947, with image of Man on a Water-Buffalo Returning from a Village Feast : postcard references looking for books for Georgia O'Keeffe.\nEphemera found between pp. 212-213 : Blank postcard with image of Waves at Matsushima, No. 1 ; Blank postcard with image of Waves at Matsushima, No. 2.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nPage marker found between : pp. 82-83 ; pl. xx-p. 151 ; pl. xxi-p. 157.\nPlates accompanied by guard sheets with descriptive letterpress.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}